name: capability-pinned
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a boundary that already existed is recorded in the suite — a
  delegated refusal, an unruled edge, a host-owned diagnostic — pinned
  such that the pin itself goes red the day the boundary moves
  (BACKEND_COMPILE_ERROR refusing once an error[KORU…] fires, a BROKEN
  flipping green). Distinct from capability-added (new surface that
  works) and defect-closed (something wrong made right): here nothing
  changed about what compiles — what changed is that the seam is now
  observable and self-invalidating instead of tribal knowledge.
